Z||000003||revin||12-25-2001||11:17 AM||||Well yes I have no dipstick, but I have it  pluged good. (Yee Haw!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I guess I never looked or thought about the seals...but I have seen the leak around where the two case pieces come together. I even cleaned it good and tried to seal it up with this urathane stuff(the black gooie stuff around winshield) ha ha I figured that if it holds the water from getting in on the windows....<BR>Well yes it did work and still holds fairly well( very small amounts) anyway.......<BR>Did I say I need a Dipstick??HELLOOOOOOO <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
